### Health
GET http://localhost:4000/health

### List Sites
GET http://localhost:4000/api/sites

### Simulate entry crossing
POST http://localhost:4000/api/sensor/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "siteId": "site-temple-view",
  "gateId": "gate-1",
  "direction": "in"
}

### Simulate exit crossing
POST http://localhost:4000/api/sensor/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "siteId": "site-temple-view",
  "gateId": "gate-1",
  "direction": "out"
}

### Recommendations
GET http://localhost:4000/api/recommendations?lat=11.02&lng=76.97&limit=3

### Nearby hospitals
GET http://localhost:4000/api/nearby?lat=11.02&lng=76.97&type=hospital&radius=3000&limit=5

### Nearby police
GET http://localhost:4000/api/nearby?lat=11.02&lng=76.97&type=police&radius=3000&limit=5

### Nearby essentials
GET http://localhost:4000/api/nearby?lat=11.02&lng=76.97&type=essentials&radius=3000&limit=5
